0.0351, 0.1782] and within feature_002=0 +0.0937 [0.0244, 0.1630] are below threshold, and within feature_002=1 was null. Broad negative results still include marker and signature main effects, marker-marker and marker-signature interactions, feature_011, feature_035, the severity contrast, and the feature_002 high-log-PFS interaction. The next analysis panel should use the existing active claims: feature_010, feature_048, feature_037, feature_023, feature_060, feature_063, and feature_033 main effects; feature_007 by feature_046 interaction; feature_002 interactions by high severity, feature_046 level_001, and feature_052 level_003; and feature_003 low severity. If the feature_003 low-severity contrast does not exceed threshold, close the feature_003 threshold line. If feature_002 interactions reveal large effect modification, register a focused refinement; otherwise consider validating feature_002 H47 only to characterize external reproducibility rather than acceptance. All conclusions remain associations in this supplied dataset and do not establish causality or biological roles.",
