ng 8. Broad negative results include feature_007/058/015 main effects, feature_024/041/011/001/035, feature_053 severity contrast, marker-signature and marker-marker interactions, feature_007 high-log-PFS and feature_041 high-log-PFS interactions, feature_002 high-log-PFS interaction, exact continuous signature contrasts H1-H3 and exact log-PFS contrast H9 invalid or closed."
